# Software records in DOAP (http://usefulinc.com/ns/doap#).
#
# The file is a set of batches, each with its own header comment. The first is
# Early Linked Web Storage implementations; the last is NLnet-funded
# ActivityPub work, whose grants live in data/nlnet.ttl.
#
# LWS batch — Source: the Touchstone conformance runs reported at
# https://ebremer.com/lws/conformance (2026-10-19 / 2026-10-21), plus each
# repository's own metadata. Every entry implements lws10-core.
#
# Dependencies use the catalog's own ex:hasDependencyOn predicate (there is no
# DOAP property for them); the Titanium libraries below carry doap:implements
# for the specs they actually implement, which is what lets a pinned spec match
# against a dependency.
#
# Licenses are SPDX identifiers taken from each project's own metadata
# (GitHub license detection, Cargo.toml, composer.json, package.json).
#
# Repositories and the tested build are IRIs (the GitHub repo / commit), never
# blank nodes, so re-posting this file is idempotent.
#
# Seeded with `devbox run seed` (see devbox.json), so the UI reads it from the
# same Fuseki dataset as the W3C + Specref data.


@prefix doap: <http://usefulinc.com/ns/doap#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org#> .

